{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"liuliao-e-o079","title":"魏略异说亮死令延摄行仪攻延","accounts":[{"id":"liuliao-a-1ca02a9b6aa909cb13a7","label":"裴注·魏略（异说）","text":"魏略异说亮死令延摄行仪攻延","evidence":["liuliao-q-1b34bb87b09da04cd707"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhuge-liang","role":"病谓延等云我之死后但谨自守慎勿复来也、令延摄行己事密持丧去","evidence":["liuliao-q-1b34bb87b09da04cd707"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0091","role":"遂匿之、行至褒口乃发丧、本无此心不战军走、被追而杀之","evidence":["liuliao-q-1b34bb87b09da04cd707"]},{"person":"zhuge-p0045","role":"宿与延不和、见延摄行军事惧为所害、乃张言延欲举众北附、遂率其众攻延","evidence":["liuliao-q-1b34bb87b09da04cd707"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liuliao-q-1b34bb87b09da04cd707"]},"ordering_evidence":"liuliao-q-1b34bb87b09da04cd707","source_order":[40,324,0],"order":7316}],"persons":[{"id":"xianzhu-p0091","name":"魏延","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhuge-liang","name":"诸葛亮","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhuge-p0045","name":"杨仪","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liuliao-q-1b34bb87b09da04cd707","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-6dc52065d442a8329e1d","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏略》曰：“诸葛亮病，谓延等云：‘我之死后，但谨自守，慎勿复来也！’令延摄行己事，密持丧去。延遂匿之，行至褒口，乃发丧。亮长史杨仪，宿与延不和，见延摄行军事，惧为所害；乃张言延欲举众北附，遂率其众攻延。延本无此心，不战军走，追而杀之。”","attribution":"裴注·魏略（异说）","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":323,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-a579fc2d130429316a3e","start":0,"end":122}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
